  "body": "Currently if A invites B to a room and gives the room a silly name, there's nothing B can do about it, which can be very annoying especially if A is awol.  We should do IRC-style semantics where room topics may be changed by unprivileged users (unless you deliberately lock the topic/name).\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-89)\n\n(Reported by @ara4n)\n",
